sequenceDiagram
  title Checkout
  actor C as Customer
  participant O as Order service
  participant I as Inventory
  participant P as Payment
  C->>O: Place order
  O->>I: Reserve stock
  alt in stock
      I-->>O: Reserved
      O->>P: Charge card
      P-->>O: Paid
      O-->>C: Order confirmed
  else out of stock
      I-->>O: Not enough stock
      O-->>C: Sold out
  end
  Note right of I: Reservation lasts 15 min
